WEBVTT

00:04:29.974 --> 00:04:31.350
This clearly demonstrates

00:04:31.350 --> 00:04:34.979
that the solutions to Africa’s health
problems must be homegrown

00:04:34.979 --> 00:04:36.856
and they must be led by Africans.

00:04:37.773 --> 00:04:39.984
I am helping to come up
with those solutions

00:04:39.984 --> 00:04:42.695
through my research work
on infectious diseases here.

00:04:43.654 --> 00:04:47.867
After all, we, the Africans,
know what’s best

00:04:47.867 --> 00:04:52.204
when it comes to health priorities
and workable solutions for Africa.

00:04:53.539 --> 00:04:54.957
On that note,

00:04:54.957 --> 00:04:56.459
I wish you good health,

00:04:56.459 --> 00:04:57.460
and thank you.